INSERT INTO `tb_soal` VALUES (1,1,'What is the most appropriate response when someone says \"Good morning\"?','Good night','Good morning','Good bye','I am sorry','B'),(2,1,'Which expression is used when you are going to bed at night?','Good evening','Good afternoon','Good night','Good morning','C'),(3,1,'A: \"See you later, Edo!\" - B: \"___!\"','See you!','Good morning','Nice to meet you','You are welcome','A'),(4,2,'What should you say when someone helps you carry heavy books?','I am sorry','Thank you very much','Excuse me','Goodbye','B'),(5,2,'A: \"Thank you for the delicious cookies.\" - B: \"___\"','Never mind','You are welcome','I am sorry','See you','B'),(6,2,'You accidentally step on your friend\'s shoe. You say: \"___\"','Thank you','I am sorry','You are welcome','Good job','B'),(7,3,'My father\'s brother is my ___.','Aunt','Uncle','Cousin','Grandfather','B'),(8,3,'The daughter of my parents is my ___.','Sister','Brother','Uncle','Son','A'),(9,3,'What is the English word for \"Nenek\"?','Mother','Aunt','Grandmother','Niece','C'),(10,4,'Which word is a verb (kata kerja)?','Apple','Run','Beautiful','Quickly','B'),(11,4,'The students ___ English in the classroom every Monday.','study','happy','book','smart','A'),(12,4,'What is the Indonesian meaning of \"Write\"?','Membaca','Menulis','Mendengar','Berlari','B'),(13,5,'Budi is a diligent student. ___ always wakes up early.','She','He','It','They','B'),(14,5,'This is my bag. ___ color is black.','Its','His','Her','Our','A'),(15,5,'Rina and I are classmates. ___ study together at the library.','They','We','You','She','B'),(16,6,'Which of the following is an ordinal number?','Five','Fifth','Ten','Twenty','B'),(17,6,'There are ___ days in a week.','seven','seventh','first','third','A'),(18,6,'Today is my brother\'s ___ birthday. He is turning 12.','twelve','twelfth','second','twenty','B'),(19,7,'The day after Wednesday is ___.','Tuesday','Thursday','Friday','Sunday','B'),(20,7,'Indonesian Independence Day is celebrated in the month of ___.','July','August','September','October','B'),(21,7,'What is the eighth month of the year?','August','July','May','June','A'),(22,8,'What time is 08:30 in English?','It is a quarter past eight','It is half past eight','It is eight o\'clock','It is a quarter to nine','B'),(23,8,'If it is 09:15, we say: \"It is ___.\"','a quarter to nine','a quarter past nine','half past nine','nine o\'clock','B'),(24,8,'What expression is used to ask the time?','What time is it?','Where do you live?','How old are you?','What is your name?','A'),(25,9,'The English class starts ___ 07:30 AM.','in','on','at','to','C'),(26,9,'We celebrate National Education Day ___ May 2nd.','in','on','at','of','B'),(27,9,'My sister was born ___ 2012.','in','on','at','by','A'),(28,10,'Where do students go to borrow and read books?','Hospital','Library','Market','Post office','B'),(29,10,'Which of the following is a tool used for cutting paper?','Broom','Scissors','Hammer','Ruler','B'),(30,10,'Which of the following is a creature that can fly?','Whale','Rabbit','Eagle','Tiger','C'),(31,11,'Which of the following is an UNCOUNTABLE noun?','Pencil','Water','Chair','Apple','B'),(32,11,'What is the plural form of \"Box\"?','Boxs','Boxes','Boxies','Boxen','B'),(33,11,'Which noun can be counted directly with numbers (1, 2, 3)?','Sugar','Oil','Book','Salt','C'),(34,12,'___ apples are there on the table?','How much','How many','How long','How often','B'),(35,12,'___ milk is left in the refrigerator?','How many','How much','How far','How old','B'),(36,12,'Customer: \"___ is this school uniform?\" - Seller: \"It is Rp 75.000.\"','How many','How much','How big','How many times','B'),(37,13,'She eats ___ orange every morning.','a','an','the','some','B'),(38,13,'Mr. Budi bought ___ new car yesterday.','a','an','many','those','A'),(39,13,'Look at ___ moon! It is very bright tonight.','a','an','the','this','C'),(40,14,'The cat is hiding ___ the table because it is afraid of thunder.','under','between','on','in','A'),(41,14,'My classroom is located ___ the computer lab and the library.','on','under','between','at','C'),(42,14,'Please put the glass of water ___ the table carefully.','on','in','between','under','A'),(43,15,'What is the purpose of a descriptive text?','To tell a funny past story','To describe a specific person, animal, or place','To explain how to make something','To invite someone to a party','B'),(44,15,'The opening part of a descriptive text that introduces the object is called ___.','Orientation','Identification','Description','Resolution','B'),(45,15,'Which tense is dominantly used in descriptive texts?','Simple Past Tense','Simple Future Tense','Simple Present Tense','Past Continuous Tense','C'),(46,16,'A: \"What does your English teacher look like?\" - B: \"___\"','He teaches English','He is tall and wears glasses','He goes to school by bike','He lives in Medan','B'),(47,16,'If someone asks \"What is your best friend like?\", they want to know about your friend\'s ___.','Personality / Character','Shoe size','House address','Phone number','A'),(48,16,'Complete the dialogue: \"A: What does your cat look like? - B: It has white fur and ___ eyes.\"','blue','run','bark','swim','A'),(49,17,'Which word is an adjective (kata sifat)?','Quickly','Beautiful','Sing','Desk','B'),(50,17,'Fernando always helps his friends do their homework. Fernando is very ___.','lazy','helpful','angry','noisy','B'),(51,17,'The opposite (lawan kata) of \"Difficult\" is ___.','Easy','Hard','Heavy','Fast','A'),(52,18,'My sister ___ to SMP Swasta Nommensen by bicycle every morning.','go','goes','went','going','B'),(53,18,'They ___ not like drinking bitter coffee.','do','does','is','are','A'),(54,18,'___ your father read the newspaper before going to work?','Do','Does','Is','Are','B'),(55,19,'What is the main benefit of analyzing songs in learning English?','To memorize singer names only','To understand moral values, emotions, and new vocabulary','To write exam questions','To dance at school','B'),(56,19,'A song lyric says: \"You can count on me like one, two, three, I will be there.\" The theme of this song is ___.','Friendship','Disappointment','History','Science','A'),(57,19,'The positive advice or life lesson we learn from a song is called ___.','Chord','Moral message','Instrument','Microphone','B'),(58,20,'A: \"Do you like watching action movies?\" - B: \"Yes, I ___ them very much!\"','hate','dislike','love','ignore','C'),(59,20,'Which of the following sentences expresses DISLIKE?','I really enjoy swimming in the afternoon.','I love vanilla ice cream.','I dislike bitter melon because of its taste.','Playing basketball is my favorite hobby.','C'),(60,20,'Complete the sentence: \"My brother is fond of ___ guitar.\"','play','playing','plays','played','B'),(61,1,'You meet your English teacher at 02:00 PM at school. What is the proper greeting?','Good morning, Sir.','Good afternoon, Sir.','Good evening, Sir.','Good night, Sir.','B'),(62,1,'A: \"How do you do, Mr. Siregar?\" - B: \"___\"','I am fine, thank you.','How do you do.','Good night.','Nice to see you tomorrow.','B'),(63,1,'Which greeting is considered informal and usually said to close friends?','Good morning','Good afternoon','What\'s up?','How do you do?','C'),(64,1,'Rian meets Edo at 07:00 PM in front of the cinema. What should Rian say?','Good night, Edo.','Good evening, Edo.','Good morning, Edo.','Goodbye, Edo.','B'),(65,1,'A: \"How are you doing today, Sinta?\" - B: \"___\"','I am reading a book.','I am very well, thanks.','You are welcome.','I am going to school.','B'),(66,1,'Which of the following is an expression of leave-taking (parting)?','Nice to meet you','Good morning','Take care!','Hello!','C'),(67,1,'When you want to end a conversation with a friend because you have to go home, you say: \"___\"','Good morning','I must be going now. Bye!','How are you?','Excuse me, Sir.','B'),(68,1,'Siti: \"Goodbye, Dayu. Have a nice weekend!\" - Dayu: \"Goodbye, Siti. ___!\"','Thank you, you too','I am sorry','Never mind','Don\'t mention it','A'),(69,1,'What is the Indonesian meaning of \"See you tomorrow\"?','Sampai jumpa nanti','Sampai jumpa besok','Selamat tinggal selamanya','Senang bertemu denganmu','B'),(70,1,'You meet a new student named David for the very first time. You say: \"___\"','Good night, David!','Nice to meet you, David.','See you yesterday, David.','I apologize to you.','B'),(71,1,'A: \"Good morning, class!\" - Students: \"___\"','Good evening, Ma\'am!','Good morning, Ma\'am!','Goodbye, Ma\'am!','Good night, Ma\'am!','B'),(72,1,'Which expression is used to ask about someone\'s condition or health?','How are you feeling?','Where do you live?','What is your hobby?','What is your name?','A'),(73,1,'Teacher: \"That\'s all for today. See you next week!\" - Students: \"___\"','See you next week, Sir!','You are very kind, Sir!','I am not ready, Sir!','Good morning, Sir!','A'),(74,1,'Before sleeping at 09:30 PM, Ani says to her mother: \"___\"','Good evening, Mom.','Good night, Mom.','Good afternoon, Mom.','Goodbye forever, Mom.','B'),(75,1,'A: \"Nice to meet you, Beni.\" - B: \"___\"','Nice to meet you too.','You are welcome.','I am sorry.','Never mind.','A'),(76,1,'Which word has the same meaning as \"Farewell\"?','Greeting','Parting','Apology','Gratitude','B'),(77,1,'Mother: \"Have a great day at school, dear!\" - Child: \"___, Mom!\"','I am sorry','Thank you and see you','Good night','Never mind','B'),(78,2,'Your classmate lends you an eraser. What is the most polite response?','Never mind','Thank you so much','I am sorry','Excuse me','B'),(79,2,'A: \"Thanks a lot for inviting me to your birthday party.\" - B: \"___\"','Don\'t mention it','I apologize','I am sorry','Excuse me','A'),(80,2,'When you arrive late to the English class, you should say to the teacher: \"___\"','Thank you, Sir!','I am terribly sorry for being late, Sir.','Never mind, Sir.','You are welcome, Sir.','B'),(81,2,'A: \"I broke your ruler by accident. I am really sorry.\" - B: \"___\"','You\'re welcome','That\'s alright, don\'t worry about it','Thank you very much','I am fine','B'),(82,2,'Which of the following phrases is used to express gratitude?','I owe you an apology','I really appreciate your help','Please forgive me','Excuse my mistake','B'),(83,2,'A: \"Thank you for accompanying me to the clinic.\" - B: \"___\"','My pleasure!','I am so sorry.','That is a big mistake.','Pardon me.','A'),(84,2,'What does the phrase \"Never mind\" mean in Indonesian?','Terima kasih kembali','Tidak apa-apa / jangan dipikirkan','Sama-sama','Minta maaf','B'),(85,2,'Mother: \"Here is some pocket money for you.\" - Son: \"___, Mom!\"','Thank you very much','I am sorry','Never mind','Pardon me','A'),(86,2,'You spilled water on your friend\'s notebook. What should you say immediately?','Thank you for the water','I am so sorry, let me wipe it for you','You are welcome','Good job','B'),(87,2,'A: \"Thanks for helping me fix my bicycle.\" - B: \"___\"','Anytime!','Sorry!','Excuse me!','I disagree!','A'),(88,2,'Which expression is a formal apology?','My bad!','Please accept my sincere apology.','Oops, sorry!','No problem.','B'),(89,2,'When someone says \"I\'m sorry to hear that\", they are expressing: \"___\"','Gratitude','Sympathy / condolences','Anger','Happiness','B'),(90,2,'Teacher: \"Thank you for cleaning the whiteboard, Joko.\" - Joko: \"___, Sir.\"','You are welcome','I am sorry','Never mind','Take care','A'),(91,2,'Which response is INCORRECT when responding to \"Thank you\"?','You\'re welcome','My pleasure','Don\'t mention it','I am sorry','D'),(92,2,'A: \"Please forgive me for forgetting your notebook.\" - B: \"___\"','It doesn\'t matter. You can bring it tomorrow.','You are welcome.','Thank you very much.','Good night.','A'),(93,2,'What is the synonym of \"Gratitude\"?','Thankfulness','Apology','Anger','Sadness','A'),(94,2,'A: \"I cannot come to your study group today, I have a fever. I am sorry.\" - B: \"___\"','That\'s okay. Ge