an ___.','Airport','Harbor','Station','Terminal','A'),(229,10,'What is the English word for \"Palu\"?','Pliers','Hammer','Saw','Drill','B'),(230,10,'Which creature has eight tentacles and lives in the sea?','Starfish','Octopus','Crab','Seahorse','B'),(231,11,'What is the plural form of \"Child\"?','Childs','Children','Childrens','Childes','B'),(232,11,'Which of the following is a COUNTABLE noun?','Sugar','Coffee','Pencil','Sand','C'),(233,11,'What is the plural form of \"City\"?','Citys','Cities','Cityes','Citie','B'),(234,11,'Which word is an UNCOUNTABLE noun?','Bottle','Water','Glass','Cup','B'),(235,11,'What is the plural form of \"Tooth\"?','Tooths','Teeth','Teeths','Toothes','B'),(236,11,'Which of the following nouns refers to a person?','School','Teacher','Chair','Blackboard','B'),(237,11,'What is the plural form of \"Leaf\"?','Leafs','Leaves','Leafes','Leave','B'),(238,11,'Which word is a common noun (kata benda umum)?','Indonesia','Jakarta','City','SMP Nommensen','C'),(239,11,'What is the plural form of \"Man\"?','Mans','Men','Mens','Manes','B'),(240,11,'Which of the following is an uncountable noun in English?','Coin','Dollar','Money','Banknote','C'),(241,11,'What is the plural form of \"Tomato\"?','Tomatos','Tomatoes','Tomaties','Tomato','B'),(242,11,'A noun is a word that names a ___.','Person, place, thing, or idea','Action or state','Quality or trait','Relationship in time','A'),(243,11,'What is the plural form of \"Mouse\" (the animal)?','Mouses','Mice','Mices','Meese','B'),(244,11,'Which word in this sentence is a noun: \"Budi drinks fresh milk every day\"?','Drinks','Fresh','Milk','Every','C'),(245,11,'Which noun does NOT change its form in plural?','Cat','Fish','Dog','Bird','B'),(246,11,'What is the plural form of \"Foot\"?','Foots','Feet','Feets','Footes','B'),(247,11,'Which of the following is an abstract noun?','Happiness','Table','Shoe','Door','A'),(248,12,'___ water do you drink every day?','How many','How much','How long','How far','B'),(249,1