htly in the sky.','a','an','the','some','C'),(269,13,'I need ___ umbrella because it is raining outside.','a','an','the','this','B'),(270,13,'We use the article \"AN\" before words that start with a ___.','Consonant letter','Vowel sound','Capital letter','Silent letter','B'),(271,13,'Why do we say \"an hour\" instead of \"a hour\"?','Because hour starts with vowel letter','Because the letter \"h\" is silent and pronounced as a vowel sound','Because hour is a plural noun','Because hour is an adjective','B'),(272,13,'My father bought ___ European car yesterday.','a','an','the','one','A'),(273,13,'There is ___ cat under the chair. ___ cat is sleeping.','a; The','an; The','the; A','a; A','A'),(274,13,'She plays ___ guitar very well.','a','an','the','any','C'),(275,13,'I saw ___ eagle flying high in the mountains.','a','an','the','these','B'),(276,13,'Jakarta is ___ capital city of Indonesia.','a','an','the','some','C'),(277,13,'He wants to become ___ architect in the future.','a','an','the','this','B'),(278,13,'Do you have ___ ruler that I can borrow for a minute?','a','an','the','those','A'),(279,13,'We stayed at ___ hotel near the beach. ___ hotel was very clean.','a; The','an; A','the; A','an; The','A'),(280,13,'Mount Everest is ___ highest mountain in the world.','a','an','the','one','C'),(281,13,'Tina ate ___ egg and drank a glass of milk for breakfast.','a','an','the','some','B'),(282,14,'The clock is hanging ___ the wall.','in','on','at','under','B'),(283,14,'The fish is swimming ___ the aquarium.','in','on','under','between','A'),(284,14,'The shoes are placed ___ the bed.','under','between','among','in','A'),(285,14,'SMP Swasta Nommensen is located ___ the post office and the bank.','beside','between','under','above','B'),(286,14,'The teacher stands ___ the class to deliver the lesson.','in front of','behind','under','between','A'),(287,14,'The whiteboard is hanging ___ the teacher\'s desk.','behind','under','into','inside','A'),(288,14,'The dog is resting ___ the shade of a big banyan tree.','under','on','above','between','A'),(289,14,'There is a bridge ___ the river.','across / over','under','between','behind','A'),(290,14,'My house is right ___ the hospital, so I can walk there in 1 minute.','next to','under','inside','between','A'),(291,14,'Please put all your books ___ your school bag.','into / inside','above','under','behind','A'),(292,14,'A ceiling fan is spinning ___ our heads.','above','under','between','behind','A'),(293,14,'The library is situated ___ the science laboratory.','beside','under','in','into','A'),(294,14,'The girl is hiding ___ the curtain so her brother cannot see her.','behind','under','on','between','A'),(295,14,'There are three pens ___ the pencil box.','in','on','under','behind','A'),(296,14,'The car is parked ___ the garage.','in','on','under','between','A'),(297,14,'Sit down ___ this chair, please.','on','in','under','behind','A'),(298,14,'The village is nestled ___ high mountains.','among','between','under','above','A'),(299,15,'What is the generic structure of a descriptive text?','Orientation - Complication - Resolution','Identification - Description','Goal - Materials - Steps','Thesis - Arguments - Reiteration','B'),(300,15,'What is the communicative purpose of a descriptive text?','To entertain the readers with a story','To describe a particular person, place, or thing in detail','To explain how something happens step by step','To persuade people to buy something','B'),(301,15,'Which part of a descriptive text gives detailed information about characteristics, parts, and qualities?','Identification','Description','Resolution','Orientation','B'),(302,15,'Which grammatical tense is mostly used in a descriptive text?','Simple Past Tense','Simple Present Tense','Past Continuous Tense','Future Tense','B'),(303,15,'Which of the following is an example of a descriptive text title?','How to Make a Cup of Coffee','The Legend of Lake Toba','My Lovely Pet Cat, Miko','Why Smoking is Bad for Health','C'),(304,15,'In a descriptive text about a best friend, the writer describes his height, hair, and personality. This part is called ___.','Identification','Description','Complication','Steps','B'),(305,15,'Which language feature is NOT typically found in a descriptive text?','Action verbs in past tense (walked, ran)','Specific participant (e.g. My School)','Adjectives to describe features (tall, cute)','Simple Present Tense','A'),(306,15,'What does the word \"Identification\" do in a descriptive text?','Introduces who or what is being described','Tells how the story ends','Lists ingredients of a recipe','Explains why the object was created','A'),(307,15,'\"Borobudur is a magnificent Buddhist temple located in Magelang, Central Java.\" This sentence is an example of ___.','Identification','Resolution','Complication','Reorientation','A'),(308,15,'\"It has gray fur, sharp claws, and two cute round eyes.\" This sentence describes ___.','Physical appearance','Personality','Historical background','Price','A'),(309,15,'Descriptive text focuses on describing a ___ participant rather than general ones.','Specific','Universal','Fictional','Random','A'),(310,15,'Which word is an adjective commonly used in describing a person?','Friendly','Quickly','Because','Singing','A'),(311,15,'Which of the following sentences best belongs in the Description section of a school description?','Our school has 24 clean classrooms, a modern laboratory, and a lush green garden.','I am going to tell you about my school.','That is why I love going to school.','Once upon a time there was a school.','A'),(312,15,'What kind of sensory details are often used in descriptive texts?','Sight, sound, smell, touch, and taste','Opinions and arguments only','Historical dates and years','Dialogues and conflicts','A'),(313,15,'Which conjunction is commonly used in descriptive text to join similar qualities?','And','Although','However','Therefore','A'),(314,15,'\"SMP Swasta Nommensen is a wonderful junior high school in North Sumatra.\" This belongs to ___.','Identification','Description','Coda','Resolution','A'),(315,15,'Why are adjectives crucial in descriptive writing?','Because they help readers imagine and visualize the object clearly','Because they replace all nouns','Because they change the tense of the story','Because they make sentences shorter','A'),(316,16,'What is the question \"What does your father look like?\" used to ask about?','His hobby','His physical appearance','His daily routine','His job title','B'),(317,16,'A: \"What is your sister like?\" - B: \"She is cheerful and very kind.\" What does this question ask about?','Her personality and character','Her physical features','Her favorite subject','Her age and height','A'),(318,16,'A: \"___?\" - B: \"She has long curly hair, round eyes, and a pointed nose.\"','What is she doing?','Where does she live?','What does she look like?','How is she today?','C'),(319,16,'A: \"What does your new school backpack look like?\" - B: \"___\"','It costs Rp 150.000.','It is dark blue with two zippered front pockets.','I bought it with my mother.','I use it every school day.','B'),(320,16,'Which of the following questions asks about someone\'s character or attitude?','What is your best friend like?','What does your brother look like?','What is your sister wearing?','What does your dog look like?','A'),(321,16,'Which question asks about someone\'s physical appearance?','What does your English teacher look like?','What does your brother like to eat?','What is your father like?','What do you think of this film?','A'),(322,16,'Mr. Siregar is in his late 50s. He has ___ hair and a thick mustache.','grey','young','softly','slowly','A'),(323,16,'\\\"My kitten is very adorable. It has soft white fur and blue eyes.\\\" The speaker is describing the kitten\'s ___.','daily habits','physical appearance','eating schedule','birthplace','B'),(324,16,'A: \"Could you describe your lost umbrella?\" - B: \"___\"','It is very useful on rainy days.','It is bright yellow with a curved wooden handle.','I lost it yesterday afternoon.','My father bought it for me.','B'),(325,16,'\\\"Rina is very humble and never brags about her good grades.\\\" This sentence describes Rina\'s ___.','height','personality','clothes','appearance','B'),(326,16,'\\\"He is quite tall, well-built, and has an athletic body.\\\" This sentence describes someone\'s ___.','physical appearance','educational background','family members','daily routine','A'),(327,16,'A: \"What is your English teacher like?\" - B: \"She is very ___ and always explains clearly.\"','angry','patient','narrow','careless','B'),(328,16,'Complete the question: \\\"___ does your older brother look like? - He is tall and wears glasses.\\\"','Who','How','What','Where','C'),(329,16,'Which adjective describes someone\'s height?','Tall','Round','Diligent','Smart','A'),(330,16,'Which adjective describes someone\'s character or personality?','Generous','Curly','Wavy','Oval','A'),(331,16,'\\\"My mother has an oval face, sharp nose, and fair skin.\\\" These features describe her ___.','facial appearance','daily activities','profession','hobbies','A'),(332,16,'A: \"Can you tell me about SMP Swasta Nommensen?\" - B: \"It has modern classrooms, a spacious yard, and green trees.\" The speaker is ___.','describing a place','asking for directions','introducing a friend','saying goodbye','A'),(333,17,'What is an adjective (kata sifat)?','A word that shows an action','A word that modifies or describes a noun','A word that connects two clauses','A word that replaces a person\'s name','B'),(334,17,'In the phrase \"a clever student\", which word is the adjective?','a','clever','student','none of the above','B'),(335,17,'\\\"The soup is too hot to drink right now.\\\" Which word is an adjective?','soup','is','hot','drink','C'),(336,17,'Which of the following words is an adjective of size?','Enormous','Yesterday','Quickly','Beautifully','A'),(337,17,'What is the opposite (antonym) of the adjective \"Dangerous\"?','Difficult','Safe','Scary','Harmful','B'),(338,17,'What is the opposite of the adjective \"Generous\" (suka memberi)?','Kind','Stingy','Friendly','Polite','B'),(339,17,'\\\"The children are smiling and playing together. They feel very ___.\\\"','sad','happy','angry','sleepy','B'),(340,17,'Identify the adjective in the sentence: \"She bought a red ribbon yesterday.\"','She','bought','red','ribbon','C'),(341,17,'Which of the following is an adjective describing feelings or emotions?','Excited','Wooden','Triangular','Metallic','A'),(342,17,'The opposite of the adjective \"Noisy\" is ___.','Loud','Quiet','Crowded','Bright','B'),(343,17,'\\\"This mattress is very soft and ___ to sleep on.\\\"','comfortable','comfort','comfortably','comforting','A'),(344,17,'Which of the following words is NOT an adjective?','Quickly','Smart','Heavy','Clean','A'),(345,17,'\\\"Mount Everest is the highest mountain in the world. It is extremely ___.\\\"','deep','high','wide','shallow','B'),(346,17,'What is the Indonesian meaning of the adjective \"Honest\"?','Sombong','Jujur','Pemalu','Rajin','B'),(347,17,'\\\"Edo felt completely ___ after practicing soccer under the hot sun for three hours.\\\"','tired','fresh','energetic','bored','A'),(348,17,'The antonym of \"Strong\" is ___.','Powerful','Weak','Heavy','Brave','B'),(349,17,'\\\"The blue whale is a ___ mammal living in the ocean.\\\"','tiny','huge','narrow','short','B'),(350,18,'What is Simple Present Tense primarily used for?','To describe events happening at this exact moment','To express daily habits, routines, and general facts','To talk about past historical events','To make plans for next year','B'),(351,18,'He ___ his teeth every morning and before going to bed.','brush','brushes','brushing','brushed','B'),(352,18,'The earth ___ around the sun.','revolve','revolves','revolved','revolving','B'),(353,18,'Change this sentence into negative: \"She likes spicy food.\"','She not likes spicy food.','She does not like spicy food.','She do not like spicy food.','She is not liking spicy food.','B'),(354,18,'Change this sentence into a question: \"You play badminton on Saturday.\"','Are you play badminton on Saturday?','Do you play badminton on Saturday?','Does you play badminton on Saturday?','Did you played badminton on Saturday?','B'),(355,18,'A: \"Does your mother cook breakfast every morning?\" - B: \"Yes, she ___.\"','do','does','is','did','B'),(356,18,'We ___ to SMP Swasta Nommensen by bus every day.','go','goes','went','going','A'),(357,18,'Andi and Budi ___ football in the school yard every afternoon.','play','plays','playing','played','A'),(358,18,'A domestic cat usually ___ fresh milk and fish.','drink','drinks','drinking','drank','B'),(359,18,'Water ___ at 100 degrees Celsius under normal pressure.','boil','boils','boiled','boiling','B'),(360,18,'\\\"My father ___ work on Sundays because the office is closed.\\\"','do not','does not','is not','are not','B'),(361,18,'They ___ always friendly and helpful to new students.','is','am','are','be','C'),(362,18,'Which sentence is grammatically CORRECT in Simple Present Tense?','He study English every night.','He studies English every night.','He studying English every night.','He does studies English every night.','B'),(363,18,'\\\"___ Maria speak English fluently with her teacher?\\\"','Do','Does','Is','Are','B'),(364,18,'Which time signal is typical for Simple Present Tense?','Yesterday','Last night','Every morning','Two days ago','C'),(365,18,'The sun ___ in the east and sets in the west.','rise','rises','rose','rising','B'),(366,18,'A: \"Do you have any brothers or sisters?\" - B: \"No, I ___.\"','don\'t','doesn\'t','am not','haven\'t','A'),(367,19,'What is the main theme of a song with lyrics about supporting a friend through hard times?','Romantic breakups','True friendship and loyalty','Studying for school exams','Going on a holiday alone','B'),(368,19,'What do we call the repeated section of a song that usually delivers the central message?','Intro','Chorus / Refrain','Solo guitar','Outro','B'),(369,19,'A song lyric says: \"Don\'t give up, keep your head high, tomorrow brings a new light.\" What is the moral value?','Persistence and optimism','Laziness and giving up','Pride and arrogance','Anger and hatred','A'),(370,19,'What does the word \"lyrics\" refer to in music?','The instruments used in a concert','The written words or text of a song','The dance moves in a music video','The price of a music album','B'),(371,19,'In the lyric \"I\'ll stand by you through thick and thin\", what does \"through thick and thin\" mean?','Only in good and happy moments','In both good times and difficult times','When we are having dinner together','Only when someone is rich','B'),(372,19,'A song with fast tempo, cheerful melody, and uplifting lyrics has an ___ mood.','joyful and optimistic','gloomy and sad','frightening and scary','exhausting','A'),(373,19,'Why do songwriters use figurative language and metaphors in their lyrics?','To confuse the listeners on purpose','To express deep emotions and vivid imagery','To make the song shorter','To avoid using English words','B'),(374,19,'The lyric \"A friend in need is a friend indeed\" teaches us that ___.','real friends help each other during tough times','friends are only needed for doing homework','it is better to have no friends at all','money is more important than friends','A'),(375,19,'\\\"We are the world, we are the children, let\'s make it a better place.\\\" What social value is conveyed?','Competition and division','Global peace, love, and compassion','Individual selfishness','Winning sports tournaments','B'),(376,19,'A person who composes the words and poetry for a song is known as a ___.','Lyricist / Songwriter','Conductor','Photographer','Audience member','A'),(377,19,'In the lyric \"You are my sunshine\", why is the person compared to sunshine?','Because they are very hot','Because they bring warmth, happiness, and cheer','Because they live in the sky','Because they wake up early','B'),(378,19,'What lesson can be taken from a song that praises parents\' unconditional love?','Gratitude and respect for our parents','Rebellion against parental advice','Ignoring family members','Forgetting our childhood','A'),(379,19,'The lyric \"Stand by me when the storm comes\" is a request for ___.','financial loan','moral support and presence','an umbrella in the rain','a fast car ride','B'),(380,19,'How does learning English through songs help students?','It improves listening comprehension and vocabulary retention','It replaces all grammar rules completely','It guarantees winning singing competitions','It stops students from reading textbooks','A'),(381,19,'When a song\'s lyrics describe dark clouds, heavy rain, and loneliness, the mood is most likely ___.','melancholic and sorrowful','humorous and silly','energetic and party-like','aggressive and angry','A'),(382,19,'What does the metaphor \"Reach for the stars\" mean in an encouraging song?','Build a spaceship to travel to Mars','Aim high and work hard to achieve your dreams','Stay awake looking at the night sky','Draw stars on your notebook','B'),(383,19,'What element makes song lyrics pleasant and easy to remember?','Rhythm and rhyme pattern','Difficult and confusing words','Grammatical errors','Lack of any musical beat','A'),(384,20,'Which of the following sentences expresses strong LIKING or passion?','I can\'t stand playing basketball.','I am passionate about playing the violin.','I don\'t really care about musical instruments.','I hate acoustic guitars.','B'),(385,20,'\\\"I can\'t stand eating raw bitter melon.\\\" What does \"can\'t stand\" express here?','Strong like','Strong dislike or intolerance','Indifference','Curiosity','B'),(386,20,'A: \"Do you like listening to English pop songs?\" - B: \"Yes, I ___ them very much!\"','hate','dislike','enjoy','refuse','C'),(387,20,'Which preposition correctly completes the phrase: \"She is fond ___ reading classic novels.\"?','at','with','of','for','C'),(388,20,'Complete the sentence: \"Budi is keen ___ learning robotics at school.\"','on','in','at','by','A'),(389,20,'\\\"Beni is crazy about football.\\\" What does this sentence mean?','Beni hates football.','Beni loves football immensely.','Beni doesn\'t know how to play football.','Beni is angry when playing football.','B'),(390,20,'Which sentence clearly expresses DISLIKE?','I find washing dirty dishes very tedious and annoying.','Swimming in the ocean is my favorite holiday activity.','I am fond of cooking Italian pasta.','Painting portraits brings me great joy.','A'),(391,20,'A: \"What is your favorite free-time activity?\" - B: \"I really enjoy ___ novels in my bedroom.\"','read','reading','reads','readed','B'),(392,20,'\\\"I\'m not really into mobile video games.\\\" What does the speaker mean?','I play games 10 hours a day.','I don\'t like mobile video games very much.','I am a professional gamer.','I make mobile video games for a living.','B'),(393,20,'A: \"I love swimming in the morning, it makes me energized!\" - What is a proper response showing agreement?','Me too! It keeps our body fresh and healthy.','I hate mornings so much.','Why do you bother?','I don\'t care at all.','A'),(394,20,'What is the direct antonym of the word \"Love\"?','Like','Enjoy','Hate','Adore','C'),(395,20,'\\\"My sister prefers drinking fresh juice ___ fizzy soda drinks.\\\"','to','than','from','with','A'),(396,20,'He dislikes ___ up early on Sunday mornings because he wants to rest.','waking','wake','wakes','woke','A'),(397,20,'How can you politely express that you do not like a certain dish offered to you?','Your food is terrible!','I am not really fond of spicy food, but thank you!','Take this away from me immediately!','I never want to see this dish again!','B'),(398,20,'A: \"How do you feel about horror movies?\" - B: \"I ___ them. They give me terrible nightmares.\"','adore','detest','enjoy','recommend','B'),(399,20,'\\\"My younger sister is very enthusiastic about learning ballet.\\\" This means she ___.','is forced to practice ballet','really loves and is excited about ballet','dislikes dancing ballet','feels bored during ballet classes','B'),(400,20,'Which of the following sentences correctly expresses a preference?','I prefer drinking milk than tea.','I prefer drinking milk to tea.','I prefer milk more than tea.','I prefer milk over than tea.','B');
